{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEP","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"西番雅书","commonName":"西番雅书","title":"西番雅书","order":36,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"98f8dfeb620c73641ccea72d07fa22d2f625c270eca8d5133c42650f815febd2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEP/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEP/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":52},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的罪恶和救赎"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"这悖逆、污秽、欺压的城有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她不听从命令，不领受训诲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不倚靠耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不亲近她的 神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她中间的首领是咆哮的狮子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的审判官是晚上的豺狼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一点食物也不留到早晨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的先知是虚浮诡诈的人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的祭司亵渎圣所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"强解律法。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华在她中间是公义的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"断不做非义的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每早晨显明他的公义，无日不然；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只是不义的人不知羞耻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我—耶和华已经除灭列国的民；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的城楼毁坏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使他们的街道荒凉，以致无人经过；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的城邑毁灭，以致无人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也无居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我说：你只要敬畏我，领受训诲；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如此，你的住处不致照我所拟定的除灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只是你们从早起来就在一切事上败坏自己。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：你们要等候我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到我兴起掳掠的日子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我已定意招聚列国，聚集列邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将我的恼怒—就是我的烈怒都倾在她们身上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的忿怒如火，必烧灭全地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"那时，我必使万民用清洁的言语","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好求告我—耶和华的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同心合意地事奉我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祈祷我的，就是我所分散的民","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必从古实河外来，给我献供物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当那日，你必不因你一切得罪我的事自觉羞愧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为那时我必从你中间除掉矜夸高傲之辈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也不再于我的圣山狂傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我却要在你中间留下困苦贫寒的民；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必投靠我—耶和华的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列所剩下的人必不作罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不说谎言，口中也没有诡诈的舌头；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而且吃喝躺卧，无人惊吓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["欢乐之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"锡安的民哪，应当歌唱！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，应当欢呼！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷的民哪，应当满心欢喜快乐！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华已经除去你的刑罚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赶出你的仇敌。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的王—耶和华在你中间；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不再惧怕灾祸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当那日，必有话向耶路撒冷说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要惧怕！锡安哪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要手软！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华—你的 神是施行拯救、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大有能力的主。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他在你中间必因你欢欣喜乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"默然爱你，且因你喜乐而欢呼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些属你、为无大会愁烦、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你担当羞辱的，我必聚集他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，我必罚办一切苦待你的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又拯救你瘸腿的，聚集你被赶出的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些在全地受羞辱的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使他们得称赞，有名声。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，我必领你们进来，聚集你们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使你们被掳之人归回的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必使你们在地上的万民中有名声，得称赞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女子；下同","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEP/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HAG/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEP/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}